item_0ed1_storage	db	3h,1h,3h,9h
	db	'      This option reserves a portion of memory t'
item_0f05_storage	db	'o be used as a Logical'
	db	0h
	db	'Disk Drive, referred to as M:.  The user selects the starting address,'
	db	0h
	db	'and the XIOS allocates all of the contiguous memory above that address'
	db	0h
	db	'to MDisk.   If no memory is located at the starting address, or if the'
	db	0h
	db	'starting address is zero, then no MDisk will be created.'
	db	0h,0h
