item_1347_storage	db	3h,1h,3h,9h
	db	'    This option sets a Head Step Time of 2 to 32 mSec for the Diskette'
	db	0h
	db	'Drive Hardware.  The smaller the time, the faster the Drive Head moves'
	db	0h
	db	'from track to track.   The default time is set to 8 mSec, but times of'
	db	0h
	db	'6 mSec or 4 mSec work with some Diskette Drives.   Caution is advised.'
	db	0h,0h
